{"quest_id": 6348, "name": "記憶を求めて", "description": "ランファの記憶を求め、華の国へと向かう\n王子達の前に、魔物の群れが襲い来る。\n飛来し迫る、魔物達を迎撃せよ！\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "屍人想ウ華ノ残香", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920102, "map_no": 5279, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "exp": 200, "gold": 850, "drops": [{"card": 242, "c": 1}, {"card": 68, "c": 2}, {"item": 1001, "c": 1}, {"item": 5002, "c": 1}, {"card": 1654, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 4000, "attack": 450, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 450, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_range": 60, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 120, "attack_interval": 421, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.75, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097744, "race_id": 2, "missile_id": 4, "missile": {"speed": 4.0}, "master_id": 30473, "global_id": 4092, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 8, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2000, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_range": 60, "attack_speed": 57, "attack_wait": 180, "attack_interval": 541, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097232, "race_id": 2, "missile_id": 4, "missile": {"speed": 4.0}, "master_id": 30692, "global_id": 4311, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 11, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 7}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 153, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097360, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 16, "spawn_sec": 40}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097632, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 35, "global_id": 34, "spawn_sec": 67}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 74}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "フェイ", "text": "みんなー、この峠を越えれば華の国だよー。", "face": "u434"}, {"name": "ランファ", "text": "ありがとうございます、皆様。\nキョンシーであるばかりか、あまつさえ皆様に\n危害を加えた私にご協力してくださって……。", "face": "u579"}, {"name": "ランファ", "text": "このランファ、\n感涙で袖が濡れっぱなしです……ぐすん。", "face": "u579"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "お、お気になさらないでください。\n先日の一件は、確認もせずに貴方を\n危険だと決めつけた私たちも悪いのですから。"}, {"name": "ソーマ", "text": "でも、ランファさんの記憶にある風景を\n見つけるには、どうしたらいいのでしょうか？", "face": "u23"}, {"name": "バシラ", "text": "うーん……華の国は広いですから、\n闇雲に探すのは得策じゃなさそうですね。", "face": "u28"}, {"name": "フェイ", "text": "だいじょーぶ！\nこの超有能な風水士であるところの\nフェイちゃんに任せて！", "face": "u434"}, {"name": "フェイ", "text": "あたしの風水羅盤が\n大体の行き先を指し示してくれるから。\nあとはその通りに進めばいいんだよ。", "face": "u434"}, {"name": "ランファ", "text": "ふふ、頼りにさせていただきますね。", "face": "u579"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "――報告！　上空に多数の敵影を確認！　\n飛行する魔物の群れのようです。", "face": "u6"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "近くに魔物の巣があるようですね。\n王子、ひとまず迎撃いたしましょう。", "face": "l03600a243b7b"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "……ふぅ。なんとか撃退できましたね。", "face": "l03600a243b7b"}, {"name": "ランファ", "text": "ですが、魔物の巣はまだあちこちに見えます。\n渓谷を抜けるまでは気を抜かないでくださいね？", "face": "u579"}, {"name": "フィリス", "text": "……おい、フェイ。\n言われた通りに風水羅盤に従ったら\n危険な道に来てしまったみたいだぞ？", "face": "u40"}, {"name": "フェイ", "text": "むぅ……しょ、しょーがないでしょ？\n情報が少なすぎる以上、あたしの羅盤じゃ\n大まかな方角しかわからないんだから。", "face": "u434"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "やはり、もっと具体的な手がかりがないと\nランファさんが記憶している風景の土地に\nたどり着くのは難しそうですね。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "ランファ", "text": "申し訳ありません……お手数をおかけして。\n地名だけでも思い出せれば、とは思うのですが……。", "face": "u579"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "いえ、お気になさらないでください。\nそれでは、引き続き手がかりを探していきましょう。"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920102_5279", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 948, "y": 380}, {"k": "b", "x": 554, "y": 536}, {"k": "m", "x": 276, "y": 235, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 200, "y": 180, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 355, "y": 291, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 426, "y": 352, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 285, "y": 104, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 630, "y": 293, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 738, "y": 323, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 845, "y": 347, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 532, "y": 266, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 443, "y": 210, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 368, "y": 158, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 463, "y": 421, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 243, "y": 143, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 322, "y": 198, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 398, "y": 248, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 504, "y": 488, "id": 215}, {"k": "r", "x": 110, "y": 229, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 517, "y": 181, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 513, "y": 338, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 859, "y": 280, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 743, "y": 394, "id": 